1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:02,200
(Leonard:)if you were attached
to another object

2
00:00:02,210 --> 00:00:06,540
(Leonard:)by an inclined plane wrapped
helically around an axis?

3
00:00:06,540 --> 00:00:07,940
(Sheldon:)Screwed.

4
00:00:11,010 --> 00:00:13,150
(Leonard:)There you go.

5
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:17,270
(Sheldon:)Amy's right.

6
00:00:17,270 --> 00:00:19,940
(Sheldon:)He is tedious.

7
00:00:23,560 --> 00:00:28,250
MRS. WOLOWITZ:
Howard, get the door!

8
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:30,200
(Howard(off):)Why can't you get it?

9
00:00:30,200 --> 00:00:32,670
MRS. WOLOWITZ:
You know I'm doing a bowel cleanse

10
00:00:32,670 --> 00:00:36,370
(Mrs Wolowitz(off):)for my colonoscopy!

11
00:00:36,370 --> 00:00:40,480
(Mrs Wolowitz(off):)I'm like an upside-down
volcano here.

12
00:00:42,310 --> 00:00:44,310
(Howard:)Oh, hey.

13
00:00:44,310 --> 00:00:46,070
(Howard:)I hope you didn't hear that.

14
00:00:46,070 --> 00:00:48,180
(Leonard:)The volcano thing? No.

15
00:00:48,180 --> 00:00:50,570
(Howard:)What's with the T-shirt?

16
00:00:50,570 --> 00:00:52,070
(Howard:)You working at the
Apple store now?

17
00:00:52,070 --> 00:00:54,320
(Leonard:)No, it's just something
I threw on.

18
00:00:54,320 --> 00:00:55,610
(Howard:)I know all your shirts.

19
00:00:55,610 --> 00:00:57,030
(Howard:)That's not one of them...

20
00:00:57,030 --> 00:00:59,450
(Howard:)You were pretending to
work at the Genius Bar

21
00:00:59,450 --> 00:01:01,150
(Howard:)to pick up women,
weren't you?

